effect|PHASE_ANCHOR_EMERGENCY_DIVE|1.0	0	While at risk of being destroyed or disabled, this ship can instead perform an emergency dive into phase space, retreating from battle and suffering an additional combat readiness penalty equal to 1% of its deployment cost. The ship must have enough combat readiness to cover this cost. Only one ship per battle, regardless of side, can perform this dive.
effect|PHASE_ANCHOR_EMERGENCY_DIVE|10.0	0	While at risk of being destroyed or disabled, this ship can instead perform an emergency dive into phase space, retreating from battle and suffering an additional combat readiness penalty equal to 10% of its deployment cost. The ship must have enough combat readiness to cover this cost. Only one ship per battle, regardless of side, can perform this dive.
effect|PHASE_ANCHOR_EMERGENCY_DIVE|12.5	0	While at risk of being destroyed or disabled, this ship can instead perform an emergency dive into phase space, retreating from battle and suffering an additional combat readiness penalty equal to 12.5% of its deployment cost. The ship must have enough combat readiness to cover this cost. Only one ship per battle, regardless of side, can perform this dive.
effect|PHASE_ANCHOR_EMERGENCY_DIVE|100.0	0	While at risk of being destroyed or disabled, this ship can instead perform an emergency dive into phase space, retreating from battle and suffering an additional combat readiness penalty equal to 100% of its deployment cost. The ship must have enough combat readiness to cover this cost. Only one ship per battle, regardless of side, can perform this dive.
effect|PHASE_ANCHOR_EMERGENCY_DIVE|-10.0	0	While at risk of being destroyed or disabled, this ship can instead perform an emergency dive into phase space, retreating from battle and suffering an additional combat readiness penalty equal to -10% of its deployment cost. The ship must have enough combat readiness to cover this cost. Only one ship per battle, regardless of side, can perform this dive.
