flavour|abyssal_grid	0	Picking apart the power grids of abyssal drone wrecks, the crew work out how their couplings survive the storms of the deep and rebuild the ship's energy mounts to match. Energy weapons run cheaper and reach further, and the ship shrugs off EMP and corona storms.
type|abyssal_grid|null|0	1	<bad>10%</bad> reduced energy weapon flux cost.
type|abyssal_grid|null|1	0	<good>+100</good> to energy weapon range.
type|abyssal_grid|null|2	1	<bad>25%</bad> reduced EMP damage taken.
type|abyssal_grid|null|3	1	<bad>25%</bad> less combat readiness loss from being in a solar corona or a deep hyperspace storm.
type-detail|abyssal_grid|null|0	0	Costs 25 rat_abyssal_matter to allocate, returned when unallocated.
