flavour|adaptive_coils	0	Phase coils are less able to maintain a connection with normal space as the ship's hard flux levels rise, resulting in a greatly reduced top speed as the coils struggle to gain traction.\n\nThis modification allows the coils to handle higher levels of hard flux, increasing the threshold at which speed bottoms out.
type|adaptive_coils|null|0	0	<good>40%</good> increased hard flux level at which phased speed reaches its minimum.
type-detail|adaptive_coils|null|0	0	Mutually exclusive with <hullmod>hullmods</hullmod>:\n• <hullmod>Phase Anchor</hullmod>\n• <hullmod>Adaptive Phase Coils</hullmod>\n\nMutually exclusive with <node>node</node>:\n• <node>Phase Anchor</node>
