flavour|ballistic_momentum	0	Sailing alongside Hegemony battle lines teaches the crew the Navy's habit of arriving at speed and firing before the enemy has settled, guns thumping out what the Navy calls its heartbeat. The harder this ship is pushed past its usual burn, the harder its ballistic weapons hit.
