flavour|beautiful_nightmare	0	Stargazers fight hardest when they are dying, and the Stardust Core recovered from one, the remains of what was once a person, shows the crew how to strip the ship's safeties the moment its hull starts to fail. The ship fights on through its terminal descent, burning its readiness to do it.
type|beautiful_nightmare|null|0	0	When its hull drops below 25% during a battle, the ship enters Terminal Descent until its hull is back above 40%. During Terminal Descent, <good>25%</good> reduced hull damage taken, but peak performance time stops and venting is blocked.
