flavour|corrosion_beam	0	A corrosion emitter salvaged from a Stargazer wreck still drags stardust through whatever it touches, and the crew learns to tune this ship's beams to do the same. Beams held on a target gather stardust, which breaks loose as motes that hunt it down.
type|corrosion_beam|null|0	0	Every 2 seconds a beam weapon spends on an enemy ship's armor or hull, it launches a homing stardust mote at the target dealing <good>200</good> energy damage and <good>200</good> EMP. At most 20 of this ship's motes fly at once.
type|corrosion_beam|FRIGATE|0	0	Every 2 seconds a beam weapon spends on an enemy ship's armor or hull, it launches a homing stardust mote at the target dealing <good>200</good> energy damage and <good>200</good> EMP. At most 20 of this ship's motes fly at once.
