type|corrosion_beam|CRUISER|0	0	Every 2 seconds a beam weapon spends on an enemy ship's armor or hull, it launches a homing stardust mote at the target dealing <good>200</good> energy damage and <good>200</good> EMP. At most 20 of this ship's motes fly at once.
type|corrosion_beam|CAPITAL_SHIP|0	0	Every 2 seconds a beam weapon spends on an enemy ship's armor or hull, it launches a homing stardust mote at the target dealing <good>200</good> energy damage and <good>200</good> EMP. At most 20 of this ship's motes fly at once.
