flavour|disintegration	0	Hulls killed by Remnant energy weapons come apart around every impact in a way no human weapon manages, and taking those wrecks apart shows the crew how to tune this ship's energy weapons the same way.
type|disintegration|null|0	0	Energy weapon hits on armor strip an additional 20% of the hit's damage from the armor around the impact.
type|disintegration|FRIGATE|0	0	Energy weapon hits on armor strip an additional 20% of the hit's damage from the armor around the impact.
