flavour|doctrine_luddic_blessed_plating	0	Luddic shipwrights bless every plate they hang, and they hang far more of them than any yard would allow. Learning their slow, devout layering lets the crew build this ship's armor and hull up thicker.
type|doctrine_luddic_blessed_plating|null|0	0	<good>20%</good> increased armor.
type|doctrine_luddic_blessed_plating|null|1	0	<good>15%</good> increased hull points.
