flavour|doctrine_luddic_faithful_hands	0	The faithful do not trust machines to mend machines. Hand-repair crews drilled in the Church's way can keep this ship's systems fighting through damage and bring it back to readiness faster after battle.
type|doctrine_luddic_faithful_hands|null|0	0	<good>25%</good> less weapon and engine repair time.
type|doctrine_luddic_faithful_hands|null|1	0	<good>25%</good> increased combat readiness recovery rate.
