type|doctrine_luddic_faithful_hands|CAPITAL_SHIP|1	0	<good>25%</good> increased combat readiness recovery rate.
flavour|doctrine_luddic_penitent_hulls	0	Church salvage yards at Gilead send no ship to the breakers while it can still fly, and they keep their scarred hulls flying on patience and very little else. Learning their ways lets the crew live with this ship's damage and run it on less.
type|doctrine_luddic_penitent_hulls|null|0	1	<bad>25%</bad> less negative effects from D-mods.
type|doctrine_luddic_penitent_hulls|null|1	1	<bad>10%</bad> less supply use for maintenance.
