flavour|doctrine_luddic_pilgrim_volunteers	0	Pilgrims who sign on at Hesperus count it a blessing to stand their stations through the worst of a fight and keep vigil without complaint. With them aboard, this ship holds its peak readiness longer and loses fewer crew in battle.
