flavour|doctrine_luddic_plain_rites	0	Luddic doctrine calls this refinement vanity. Following it means stripping the system back to plain, honest machinery that offers nothing beyond its purpose.
flavour|doctrine_luddic_righteous_fury	0	Knights of Ludd gunners load each round with a prayer and fire it as a verdict. Taking up their crude, patient gunnery lets this ship's ballistic and missile weapons strike harder.
