flavour|doctrine_remnant_automated_command	0	Remnant warships never stand down, their systems cycling at a tempo built for machines that never tire. Copying that cadence into this ship's reactor and fire control would let it fight at the same pace, but the crew would struggle to bring the overdriven systems back to readiness afterwards.
