flavour|doctrine_remnant_cold_logic	0	Machines do not tire. Rewriting this ship's duty cycles the way Remnant cores run their own would keep its readiness higher and slow its decay through a long fight.
type|doctrine_remnant_cold_logic|null|0	1	<bad>25%</bad> less rate of combat readiness loss from extended deployment.
