flavour|doctrine_remnant_lumen_harmonics	0	Energy mounts pulled from Remnant wrecks cycle on patterns no human foundry ever wrote. Reworking this ship's firing cycles to match lets its energy weapons fire faster and run cooler.
type|doctrine_remnant_lumen_harmonics|null|0	0	<good>10%</good> increased energy weapon rate of fire. Burst beams instead recharge faster between bursts.
