flavour|doctrine_remnant_ordo_signal_mesh	0	A Remnant ordo moves as one mind, its ships murmuring to each other across a constant web of signals. One of the crew's aspiring scientists swears they can decode that chatter, tune this ship's sensors to it and turn it against enemy targeting.
