flavour|doctrine_remnant_swarm_logic	0	Remnant carriers launch their drones like a single thought spread across many bodies. Rebuilding this ship's flight control around their coordination routines lets its wings regroup faster and strike harder.
type|doctrine_remnant_swarm_logic|null|0	0	<good>25%</good> increased rate at which strikecraft replacement capability recovers.
type|doctrine_remnant_swarm_logic|null|1	0	Strikecraft launched from this ship have <good>15%</good> increased weapon damage.
