flavour|doctrine_tt_alpha_fire_control	0	Fire-control routines lifted from a Tri-Tachyon line ship, written by an Alpha core that never meant to share them. Patched into this ship's targeting, they steady its autofiring weapons and stretch the reach of its energy weapons.
