flavour|doctrine_tt_black_ledger_coils	0	Maintenance notes recovered from a Tri-Tachyon phase frigate's wreck, filed under a cost centre that officially does not exist, show the crew how to slip this ship's coils into p-space cheaply and shed heat while it waits there.
