flavour|doctrine_tt_escrowed_emitters	0	Tri-Tachyon sells its shield emitters with firmware locked behind subscription keys. A crew that cracks the lock on a salvaged emitter finds the full rated performance sitting under it. This ship's shields hold up better and cost less flux to keep up.
