flavour|doctrine_tt_quarterly_targets	0	Tri-Tachyon fleet doctrine ranks every target by the value it carries, and its threat tables push gunners toward the largest hulls on the field. This ship hits cruisers and capital ships harder.
type|doctrine_tt_quarterly_targets|null|0	0	<good>10%</good> increased damage to cruisers.
