flavour|dynamic_grid	0	Nightcross fits its dynamic coils to almost every hull it builds and never sells them on their own, so the crew pulls a set from a boarded Nightcross wreck and retrofits them into a hull that never shipped with one. The moment the shields come down, the power that fed them is routed to the energy weapons. The warranty, naturally, does not cover third-party installation.
type|dynamic_grid|null|0	0	Once shields have been down for 0.75/1.1/2/3 seconds while not venting or overloaded, <good>15%</good> increased energy weapon rate of fire and <good>15%</good> reduced energy weapon flux cost.
