flavour|energy_chain	0	Pulling apart the energy converters of wrecked Tri-Tachyon warships shows the crew how to tune this ship's energy bolts to glance off an enemy shield and carry on to another target. Some non-beam energy shots that hit a shield refract into the nearest other enemy, weakening with each jump.
type|energy_chain|null|0	0	Non-beam energy weapon hits that land on an enemy shield have a <good>20%</good> chance to refract: the same weapon fires a copy of the shot from that shield at the nearest other enemy ship within the weapon's range. A refracted shot that hits an enemy shield has the same chance to refract again.
type|energy_chain|null|1	0	Each refraction deals <bad>20%</bad> less damage than the shot before it.
type|energy_chain|FRIGATE|0	0	Non-beam energy weapon hits that land on an enemy shield have a <good>20%</good> chance to refract: the same weapon fires a copy of the shot from that shield at the nearest other enemy ship within the weapon's range. A refracted shot that hits an enemy shield has the same chance to refract again.
