flavour|exogrid	0	Under Exo-Tech instruction, the crew splice phase-coil components into the ship's power lattice, fusing it with the flux grid the way Exo-Tech builds its own hulls. The ship runs slightly ahead of normal time, is harder to detect and shrugs off EMP, but the hybrid grid vents more slowly and gets less from each flux vent.
