flavour|exoship	0	The last Exoship of the Exo-Tech faction, warping from system to system across the sector. Its branches travel with it.\n\nIt docks with your ship only while a Hyper-Nav Beacon sits in an allocated Subroutine Socket, and docking allocates it at no cost. Removing the beacon or unallocating its socket undocks the Exoship and releases every node reached through it.\n\nCtrl-click the Exoship to return to the beacon's socket.
