flavour|frozen_heart	0	query. hull?. scanning. [HULL] collect, amass, gather, fuse, keep. The core does not stop. Neither does anything it holds.
type|frozen_heart|null|0	0	Whenever a non-strikecraft ship is destroyed within 1500 su, this ship gains a Heartless stack until the end of combat. Ships can hold up to 5 Heartless stacks.
