flavour|furor_machinae	0	Combat recordings pulled from a Stargazer's data core show its fire rate climbing with every hit, as if something inside it were growing angrier, and the crew rewires this ship's fire control to chase the same rhythm. Digital rage climbs with every hit that lands, driving the guns faster and faster.
type|furor_machinae|null|0	0	Damage dealt to enemy ships builds fury, granting up to <good>15%</good> increased weapon rate of fire, full after 2000/4000/8000/20000 damage. Shield hits count at half, EMP at a quarter. Fury fades by 1% per second.
type|furor_machinae|FRIGATE|0	0	Damage dealt to enemy ships builds fury, granting up to <good>15%</good> increased weapon rate of fire, full after 2000/4000/8000/20000 damage. Shield hits count at half, EMP at a quarter. Fury fades by 1% per second.
