type|furor_machinae|CRUISER|0	0	Damage dealt to enemy ships builds fury, granting up to <good>15%</good> increased weapon rate of fire, full after 2000/4000/8000/20000 damage. Shield hits count at half, EMP at a quarter. Fury fades by 1% per second.
type|furor_machinae|CAPITAL_SHIP|0	0	Damage dealt to enemy ships builds fury, granting up to <good>15%</good> increased weapon rate of fire, full after 2000/4000/8000/20000 damage. Shield hits count at half, EMP at a quarter. Fury fades by 1% per second.
flavour|gravitational_drag	0	Inside a recovered Ancient Prototype, where every conduit converges on a perfectly spherical void, the crew finds the Candle's Grace device that drags at the timeflow of anything near it. Nobody aboard can say who Candle's Grace was, and the replica built from it is mostly guesswork. Nearby enemies slow, most of all while the ship is phased.
type|gravitational_drag|null|0	0	Enemy ships within 1500 su have up to <good>5%</good> less timeflow, strongest at close range, or up to <good>10%</good> less while this ship is phased. Gravitational drag from every source is capped at 25% per ship.
