flavour|ion_rounds	0	The NCA Vendor sells Ion Bolters to any well-funded mercenary, and taking one apart shows the crew how to overdrive this ship's energy shots the same way. Keep pressure on an enemy shield until its hard flux climbs, and the arcs start getting through.
type|ion_rounds|null|0	0	Energy shots that hit an enemy shield can arc through to its hull, dealing 25% of the shot's damage plus 50% as EMP. The chance is <good>15%</good> when the target is at full hard flux and falls with its hard flux.
type|ion_rounds|FRIGATE|0	0	Energy shots that hit an enemy shield can arc through to its hull, dealing 25% of the shot's damage plus 50% as EMP. The chance is <good>15%</good> when the target is at full hard flux and falls with its hard flux.
