flavour|machine_precision	0	A recovered Gamma core, kept powered just long enough to be questioned, gives up the targeting routines Remnant drones use to lead a target. Patched into this ship's fire control, they make its autofiring weapons far more accurate and stretch every weapon's reach a little.
