flavour|martyrs_payload	0	Picking through the wrecks of Luddic Path carriers showed the crew how the Path tears the engine governors out of its bombers and arms their warheads the moment they leave the deck. Bombers fly faster and harder this way, and the faithful accept that some payloads go off before they ever reach the enemy.
type|martyrs_payload|null|0	0	Bombers launched from this ship have <good>50%</good> increased top speed.
type|martyrs_payload|null|1	0	Bombers launched from this ship have <good>50%</good> increased acceleration.
type|martyrs_payload|null|2	1	Every 3 seconds, each bomber launched from this ship that still carries any payload has a <bad>5%</bad> chance to set off one full salvo from every loaded weapon at once, destroying itself and damaging every ship nearby, friend or foe. Bombers within 600 su of this ship's hull never detonate.
