flavour|nanoforge_mending	0	Stripping the repair nanoforge out of a gutted Nexus shows the crew how the Remnant keep their hulls whole long after a fight should have broken them.
type|nanoforge_mending|null|0	0	After 5 seconds without taking hull damage, repairs 1% of maximum hull per second in combat, up to 100% of maximum hull in total per deployment.
