flavour|neural_interface	0	Links this ship with the flagship, allowing the player to instantly switch which ship they are piloting without using a shuttle pod. Transferring resets the destination ship's system cooldown and adds a charge. The transfer is instant if the combined deployment points of both ships are low enough; otherwise a short transfer time applies. The destination ship must not be under the command of an officer or an AI core.
type|neural_interface|null|0	0	Transferring to either linked ship resets its ship system cooldown and adds a charge.
type-detail|neural_interface|null|0	0	Mutually exclusive with <hullmod>hullmod</hullmod>:\n• <hullmod>Neural Interface</hullmod>
