flavour|nskr_absorption	0	Disassembling the ABSORB loop from a Kingstork taught the crew how to bank the energy their shields block instead of venting it. While that reserve holds charge, the ship's guns fire faster without drawing any extra flux.
type|nskr_absorption|null|0	0	Flux taken by the shield charges a reserve of up to 1000, which drains by 100 per second. While charged, up to <good>50%</good> increased ballistic and energy weapon rate of fire, at full strength from 500 reserve. Non-beam weapons also cost less flux per shot, so their faster fire costs no extra flux.
type-detail|nskr_absorption|null|0	0	Mutually exclusive with <hullmod>hullmod</hullmod>:\n• <hullmod>ABSORB System</hullmod>
