flavour|nskr_criticalArmor	0	A prototype modspec from Kesteven R&D shows the crew how to reinforce a light hull's critical structural points. The thinner the hull's own armor, the more the refit adds.
type|nskr_criticalArmor|null|0	0	Up to <good>+400/700/900/1200</good> to armor. The bonus is highest on hulls with the least base armor and falls to <good>+150/300/400/500</good> at <hl>400/700/900/1200</hl> base armor. Can't be allocated on phase ships or on hulls with more base armor than that.
type-detail|nskr_criticalArmor|null|0	0	Mutually exclusive with <hullmod>hullmods</hullmod>:\n• <hullmod>Heavy Armor</hullmod>\n• <hullmod>Hel Carapace</hullmod>\n• <hullmod>Hel Plating</hullmod>\n• <hullmod>Critical Point Protection</hullmod>\n\nMutually exclusive with <node>node</node>:\n• <node>Heavy Armor</node>
