flavour|nskr_inertial	0	A Kesteven R&D modspec lets the crew feed the ship's own momentum into its guns. The faster the ship moves, the harder its projectile weapons hit.
type|nskr_inertial|null|0	0	<good>0.08%</good> increased ballistic and non-beam energy weapon damage for every su/s of the ship's current speed.
type|nskr_inertial|null|1	0	On hulls with Augmented Systems, also grants increased projectile speed equal to <good>100%</good> of the speed-based damage bonus.
