flavour|perseverence_through_faith	0	Luddic faithful among the crew hold that a scarred ship, like a penitent, finds its strength in hardship, and they keep its battered guns fighting with prayer and patient hands. Each d-mod this ship carries makes its weapons hit a little harder.
type|perseverence_through_faith|null|0	0	<good>2%</good> more weapon damage per D-mod, up to 5 D-mods.
