flavour|phase_hull_upgrades	0	Leaked papers from Tri-Tachyon's Hybrid Physics Division, on phase work the corporation swears it abandoned under the Treaty of Thule, show the crew how to bleed this ship's sensor emissions into the masking field phase ships throw over a fleet. Its sensors help hide the fleet from long-range detection, and the hull shrugs off more of the strain of coronas and storms.
type|phase_hull_upgrades|null|0	0	50% of this ship's sensor strength counts toward the fleet-wide reduction in detected-at range that phase ships provide. Only applies while your fleet's transponder is off.
type|phase_hull_upgrades|null|1	1	<bad>25%</bad> less combat readiness loss from being in a solar corona or a deep hyperspace storm.
type-detail|phase_hull_upgrades|null|0	0	Mutually exclusive with <hullmod>hullmod</hullmod>:\n• <hullmod>Phase Field</hullmod>
