flavour|seraphim	0	Code pulled from a dissected Seraph core, pieced back together and patched into the damage-control software. The ship mends itself on the damage it deals, and grows deadlier the longer the hunt goes on.
type|seraphim|null|0	0	Repairs hull equal to <good>10%</good> of the armor and hull damage this ship deals to enemy ships.
type|seraphim|null|1	0	Seraph Hunting Routines repair at most <good>20%</good> of this ship's maximum hull per battle.
type|seraphim|null|2	0	Up to <good>30%</good> increased ballistic and energy weapon damage, building up as this ship deals armor and hull damage to enemy ships. At the full bonus, the zero-flux speed boost works at any flux level.
type-detail|seraphim|null|0	0	Costs 25 rat_abyssal_matter to allocate, returned when unallocated.
