flavour|seraphs_grace	0	Having taken apart enough Seraph hulls to see how they feed on their own wounds, the crew rewire the ship to do the same. Every blow to armor or hull pushes its engines, weapons and flux grid harder, but the shield emitters were never built for that load.
type|seraphs_grace|null|0	0	Every 100 armor and hull damage this ship takes grants a stack of Borrowed Grace lasting 15 seconds, up to <good>20</good> stacks. Stack timers pause while the ship is phased.
type|seraphs_grace|null|1	0	Each Borrowed Grace stack grants <good>1%</good> increased top speed, flux dissipation and weapon rate of fire, and <good>1%</good> reduced weapon flux cost and damage taken.
type|seraphs_grace|null|2	0	<good>20%</good> increased weapon durability.
type|seraphs_grace|null|3	1	<bad>20%</bad> reduced weapon and engine repair time.
type|seraphs_grace|null|4	1	<good>20%</good> more damage taken by shields.
type-detail|seraphs_grace|null|0	0	Costs 25 rat_abyssal_matter to allocate, returned when unallocated.
type-detail|seraphs_grace|null|1	0	Mutually exclusive with <hullmod>hullmods</hullmod>:\n• <hullmod>Seraphs Grace</hullmod>\n• <hullmod>Raphaels Grace</hullmod>
