flavour|tania_solaris_overdrive	0	The Aracari's Solaris Phalanx primes thermo-dynamic flux cores until its guns fire without drawing on the grid. A deserter from an Aracari engine room walks the crew through a smaller version, keyed to this ship's own system.
type|tania_solaris_overdrive|null|0	0	Weapons cost no flux to fire for <good>4</good> seconds after this ship's system activates, at most once every 60 seconds.
