type|wing_scramble|CRUISER|0	0	When this ship deploys, its wings that share a role lend each other strikecraft. Each wing keeps at least 1 of its own strikecraft and fills the rest of its normal wing size with up to <good>1</good> of every other strikecraft type in its group. All its wings use the engagement range of its longest-ranged wing. Strikecraft in each group fly at the group's average top speed.
